// 边界测试2：递归、空数组、嵌套结构体、转义、浮点、负数、布尔
struct Point { x: int; y: int; }
struct Line { a: Point; b: Point; }

fn fib(n: int) -> int {
  if n <= 1 { return n; }
  return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2);
}

fn main() -> void {
  // 递归
  print(fib(10));
  print(fib(15));

  // 空数组
  let empty: int[] = [];
  print(len(empty));

  // 嵌套结构体
  let p1: Point = Point{ x: 1, y: 2 };
  let p2: Point = Point{ x: 3, y: 4 };
  let line: Line = Line{ a: p1, b: p2 };
  print(line.a.x);
  print(line.b.y);

  // 字符串转义
  print("tab\there");
  print("newline\nhere");
  print("quote\"here");

  // 浮点
  let f: float = 3.14;
  print(f);
  let f2: float = f * 2.0;
  print(f2);

  // 负数
  let neg: int = -42;
  print(neg);
  print(-neg);

  // 布尔
  let t: bool = true;
  let f3: bool = false;
  print(t && f3);
  print(t || f3);
  print(!t);

  // 比较
  print(3 < 5);
  print(3 > 5);
  print(3 == 3);
  print(3 != 4);
  print(5 >= 5);
  print(4 <= 3);
}